    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭ-mŏdus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		multusmodus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>manifold, various</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coitio potestatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. de Dogm. Plat. p. 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ambages,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M. 10, p. 253 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			 (but very dub. in <i><span class="en">Liv. 21, 3, 4</span></i>, where the correct
			read. seems to be multifariam; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">v. Fabri ad h. l.): tela, Amm 24, 2, 13: vita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Conf. 10, 17 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">allapsus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 34</span></i>
			.</div>
